{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'd1-corpus|check-fixture|D1_CORPUS|mutation' test/yang/latte_oracle_test.clj\"","aggregated_output":"2973:      ;; Payload and shape mutations refuse.\n2980:      ;; Shape-only mutation: identical contents delivered as a list in A\n3736:                      ;; translated position — a same-shape mutation\n4092:    (testing \"same-shape scalar mutations refuse\"\n4425:        mutations [[:inputs (assoc input :site-table nil)]\n4432:                 (let [failure (try (correspondence-verifier/check-fixture! mutated) nil\n4435:               mutations))))\n4473:(defn- d1-persist-and-check-fixture!\n4529:            gate (correspondence-verifier/check-fixture! input)\n4532:                (throw (ex-info \"No declaration to mutate\" {:fixture (:id fixture) :stage :mutation})))\n4534:            mutation (try (correspondence-verifier/check-fixture! mutated) nil\n4536:        (when-not (= :site-declarations (:stage mutation))\n4537:          (throw (ex-info \"Mutated declaration was not refused\" {:fixture (:id fixture) :stage :mutation})))\n4538:        {:gate gate :mutation-stage (:stage mutation) :addresses addresses\n4553:      (let [result (d1-persist-and-check-fixture! dir run fixture)]\n4555:        (is (= :site-declarations (:mutation-stage result)))\n4568:      (let [result (d1-persist-and-check-fixture! dir run fixture)]\n4570:        (is (= :site-declarations (:mutation-stage result)))\n4577:(defn- d1-corpus-batch!\n4586:  ([outcomes-file store-dir] (d1-corpus-batch! outcomes-file store-dir nil))\n4612:                                    (let [checked (d1-persist-and-check-fixture!\n4623:                                                   :mutation-refusal (:mutation-stage checked)}]\n4625:                                      (println \"d1-corpus\" id :pass (:elapsed-ms outcome) \"ms\"\n4642:                                        (println \"d1-corpus\" id